}

### DESCRIBE USER
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1
Accept: application/json

### LIST ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/users
Accept: */*
Cache-Control: no-cache

### UPDATE USER
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sergio23",
